{"ref":"BDB, מָחוֹל","hw":"מָחוֹל","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מָחוֹל</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:15\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.15\">La 5:15</a> <strong>dance</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:12\" href=\"/Psalms.30.12\">ψ 30:12</a> + 3 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחוֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.4\">Je 31:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחוֹלֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:15\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.15\">La 5:15</a>;—<em>dance</em>, token of joyousness <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:12\" href=\"/Psalms.30.12\">ψ 30:12</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מספד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.4\">Je 31:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.13\">13</a> (cf. v b), <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:15\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.15\">La 5:15</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵבֶל</span>); act of praise to <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:3\" href=\"/Psalms.149.3\">ψ 149:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 150:4\" href=\"/Psalms.150.4\">150:4</a>; accompanied by timbrel <span dir=\"rtl\">(תֹּף)</span> and sometimes other instruments <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:3\" href=\"/Psalms.149.3\">ψ 149:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:4\" href=\"/Psalms.149.4\">4</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.13\">Je 31:13</a>.","next":"BDB, מְחוֹלָה","prev":"BDB, חַלְחָלָה"}